    <string name="overlay_about">FPS is how many frames the screen showed in the last second. It drops to 0 when nothing on screen moves, that\'s normal.\n\nThe numbers update once a second and cost next to nothing. If a game gets slower with the overlay on, turn it off or pick FPS only.\n\nQuick Settings gets a Performance overlay tile once you have used the overlay.</string>

